OL,3,GNEWSAUS Amateur winner's home golf club
OL,4,A'so proud'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is the moment Jack Whaley's home
OL,7,Fgolf club erupted into cheers following
OL,8,Fhis victory in the US Amateur
OL,9,FChampionship.
OL,11,FWhaley, from Doncaster, became only the
OL,12,Fsecond Englishman to win the
OL,13,Fchampionship since 1911, earning
OL,14,Fhimself a place in the fields for the
OL,15,FMasters, US Open and The Open at St
OL,16,FAndrews in 2027.
OL,18,FThe 22-year-old was cheered on by
OL,19,Ffellow members at Rotherham Golf Club
OL,20,Fon Sunday, who described his
OL,21,Fachievement as "the pinnacle in amateur
OL,22,Fgolf".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
