OL,3,GNEWSAUS Amateur winner's home golf club
OL,4,A'so proud'
OL,5,
OL,6,FClub director Rob Norton said: "It
OL,7,Fdoesn't get any better. It's something
OL,8,Fthat you dream about as a kid growing
OL,9,Fup playing golf."
